        "# Garbage collection\n",
        "\n",
        "Garbage collection reclaims objects that are no longer reachable. CPython uses reference counting supplemented by a cyclic garbage collector.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-garbage-collection)"
      ]
